{"title": "Android tablets are back, but are they for you?", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/08/android-tablets-are-back-poll/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/android-tablets-amazon-lenovo-redmagic.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Android tablets have always been a bit of a touchy subject, but it’s abundantly clear that the form factor is making a comeback. But, as someone who’s a fan of the smaller sizes, are you actually using the gargantuan Android tablets that every company seems obsessed with? In other words – are you the customer for the Android tablets these brands are selling?</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\"><em>9to5Google Weekender by Ben Schoon is a part of our free newsletter that also includes ‘Inbox,’ a twice-weekly roundup of key stories from around the web by Daniel Bader. <a href=\"https://9to5google.beehiiv.com/subscribe\">Sign up here</a> to get Weekender delivered to your inbox every Sunday along with ‘Inbox’ on Tuesday and Thursday. <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/feature/newsletter/\">You can find past issues here</a>.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/08/android-tablets-are-back-poll/#more-735806\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-08T05:00:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-08T16:35:31.144191+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Google Messages homepage redesign: Pinned chat avatars, bottom search, corner Gemini", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/07/google-messages-pinned-chats-redesign/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/09/google-messages-thread-1.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In addition to the <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/02/google-messages-phone-icon-gradient-redesign/\">new app icon</a>, Google Messages for Android is testing a big homepage redesign that has three core components.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/07/google-messages-pinned-chats-redesign/#more-735606\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-07T14:08:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-08T16:35:31.144191+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
